<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020">
    <title>Cartman | Endpoint Health</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/modules/endpoint-health.css">
    <script src="/static/js/modules/standalone-page.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/static/js/core/module-definitions.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/static/js/modules/standalone-navigation.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/static/js/modules/endpoint-health.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand-area">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
            <span class="brand-logo">C</span>
            <span>CARTMAN</span>
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="top-actions">
        <a class="secondary-button" href="/">&#8592; Dashboard</a>
    </div>
</header>

<main class="eh-main">
    <section class="eh-heading">
        <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">CARTMAN WORKSPACE / ENDPOINT MANAGEMENT</div>
            <h1>Endpoint Health</h1>
            <p>Endpoint connectivity, agent readiness and devices that need attention.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="eh-heading-actions">
            <span class="eh-updated" data-eh-updated>Not refreshed yet</span>
            <button class="eh-button" type="button" data-eh-refresh>
                <span aria-hidden="true">&#8635;</span> Refresh
            </button>
            <button class="eh-button eh-button-subtle" type="button" data-eh-export>
                Export CSV
            </button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="eh-state-banner" data-eh-banner aria-live="polite">
        <span class="eh-banner-mark" data-eh-banner-mark>…</span>
        <div>
            <strong data-eh-banner-title>Loading endpoint status</strong>
            <p data-eh-banner-description>Reading device inventory and agent connection records.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="eh-kpis" aria-label="Endpoint status summary">
        <article class="eh-card">
            <div class="eh-card-label"><span class="eh-kpi-icon">▦</span> Registered endpoints</div>
            <strong data-eh-total>—</strong>
            <small>Devices in Cartman inventory</small>
        </article>
        <article class="eh-card">
            <div class="eh-card-label"><span class="eh-kpi-icon eh-green">●</span> Connected agents</div>
            <strong data-eh-connected>—</strong>
            <small>Currently reporting a connection</small>
        </article>
        <article class="eh-card">
            <div class="eh-card-label"><span class="eh-kpi-icon eh-red">○</span> Offline agents</div>
            <strong data-eh-offline>—</strong>
            <small>Known agents without an active connection</small>
        </article>
        <article class="eh-card">
            <div class="eh-card-label"><span class="eh-kpi-icon eh-amber">!</span> Needs attention</div>
            <strong data-eh-attention>—</strong>
            <small>Offline, missing agent or approval issue</small>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section class="eh-panel">
        <header class="eh-panel-header">
            <div>
                <h2>Endpoint status</h2>
                <p>Use this list to find a device, check its connection and open Monitoring.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="eh-record-count" data-eh-count>0 endpoints</span>
        </header>

        <div class="eh-toolbar">
            <label class="eh-search-wrap">
                <span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
                <input type="search" data-eh-search placeholder="Search name, OS, IP or agent…" aria-label="Search endpoints">
            </label>
            <select data-eh-filter aria-label="Filter endpoint status">
                <option value="all">All endpoints</option>
                <option value="connected">Connected</option>
                <option value="offline">Offline</option>
                <option value="attention">Needs attention</option>
                <option value="missing">No agent</option>
            </select>
        </div>

        <div class="eh-table-wrap">
            <table class="eh-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Endpoint</th>
                        <th>Operating system</th>
                        <th>Connection</th>
                        <th>Approval</th>
                        <th>Last seen</th>
                        <th>Action</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody data-eh-rows>
                    <tr><td colspan="6" class="eh-empty">Loading endpoint records…</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <div class="eh-table-footer">
            <span data-eh-table-note>Connection status is based on Cartman agent records.</span>
            <button type="button" class="eh-text-button" data-eh-clear>Clear filters</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="eh-monitoring-handoff">
        <div class="eh-handoff-icon">↗</div>
        <div>
            <strong>Need performance graphs?</strong>
            <p>Open Monitoring for the broader performance and service overview. Its current charts are still demo data; live per-endpoint telemetry has not been connected yet.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/pages/monitoring/" class="eh-button eh-button-subtle">Open Monitoring</a>
    </section>

    <footer class="eh-footer">
        <span>Cartman Infrastructure Management</span>
        <span>Live connection state · No fabricated CPU/RAM/disk values</span>
    </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
